  "description": "Sentenced to death for adultery, Evelyn Cordelia stands before a crowd that calls her a witch. \n\n *\"Only God knows the truth. I have never done anything to be ashamed of.\"* \n\nBefore the blade swings, she sees someone smiling in the crowd... is it her dead husband? When she opens her eyes again, she is transported to a time long before her marriage. Who is her ex-husband who feigned his own death? Who drove her family to ruin? Who accused her of adultery and infidelity? She must find out everything, even if it means she has to become the villainness of her own story. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
